Real Firstmate commands, tmux panes, installed Codex CLI, and OpenSSH were exercised. No backend responses were mocked in these live scenarios.

The first prefixed-name attempt hit a test assertion comparing a volatile command-label field. Its raw transcript is retained in live-liveness-transcript.log. The corrected isolated rerun below verifies stable pane IDs/PIDs and absence of relaunch. Other corrected setup issues and the remote-only limitations are recorded in test-setup-notes.txt.

